  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Webinar on Faculty Entrepreneurship Opportunities</h2>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n<strong>Organizing Department Name: Institutions Innovation Council (IIC)</strong>\n\n<strong>Title of the event: </strong>Faculty Entrepreneurship Opportunities\n\n<strong>Date: 11-01-2021</strong>\n\n<strong>Venue: Through MS Teams</strong>\n\n<strong>Event Description: </strong>ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru has organized a webinar on the topic “Faculty Entrepreneurship Opportunities” in association with Institutions Innovation Council on 11<sup>th</sup> January 2021. Dr. Y Shrihari Upadhyaya, Chief Executive Officer, Manipal Universal Technology Business Incubator (MUTBI) addressed the faculties from various domains on opportunities and funding scenario available to them in the field of entrepreneurship.\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
